{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1WoGy2bpx7NpRk3HzJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Fix first: Step 3, the emailed link.**\n\nA reset link that asks the user to log in first looks like a dead end, because they can't log in. That is probably what's generating the support calls. Everything before it works well enough, and everything after it is unreachable for anyone who gets stuck here.\n\n**What to do in the sprint**\n1. **Remove the login gate.** Let the single-use, time-limited token authorise the reset page. If the bank needs a stronger identity check, use step-up verification that doesn't need the old password, such as an SMS or app OTP, or a date of birth plus a card digit check. Confirm with security and compliance what they require, since a bank may have added the login on purpose.\n2. **Make the mobile web reset page work end to end.** This is the safe baseline.\n3. **Add universal links or app links only if there's capacity.** Deep-linking into the app is nicer, but it's secondary to removing the dead end. Keep the web page as the fallback.\n\n**Also this sprint, because it's cheap**\n- **Step 4:** Show the password rules up front as a live checklist, and replace \"does not meet requirements\" with the specific rule that failed. Tell users that \"not one of the last five\" can only be checked on submit.\n- **Step 1:** Move or duplicate \"Forgot password\" above the fold. This is a small layout change.\n\n**Leave alone**\n- **Step 2:** The vague message is correct, because it avoids confirming which emails have accounts. At most, add \"check spam\" and a resend option.\n\n**Caveat:** I'm working from your description and have no funnel data. Before committing, check the drop-off between \"link sent\" and \"reset completed\" and the reasons logged on support calls. If most calls are about rejected passwords rather than the login loop, swap the order of Step 3 and Step 4."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3944,"cache_read_input_tokens":4609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3944},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb0aea04-dedb-4d6e-a778-1fe6e2c59cf3","uuid":"97d3cc1e-196e-4a77-92fb-db796acb08fc","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:13:13.587Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1Wo3Kwd91hqGZnVRmZ"}
